From c133fb11ee690315084aa7e23ea280081b1e3d1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: piaozhiye <piaozhiye@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 18:10:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] es8323: capture channels_max 2 -> 16 (SAI loopback 4ch prerequisite)

RK3576 SDK 内核补丁(导出自构建机 8388-aec 分支 @ c133fb11):
codec DAI 原只报 2 通道, SAI1 SDI1 回环参考的 4ch 采集(麦+空位+refL+refR)
会被 ALSA 拒。ES8323 编进内核, 只需重编 boot.img 单分区烧写。

---
 sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c b/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
index 3506add7ba6e..caae29540803 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
@@ -713,7 +713,7 @@ static struct snd_soc_dai_driver es8323_dai = {
 	.capture = {
 		    .stream_name = "Capture",
 		    .channels_min = 1,
-		    .channels_max = 2,
+		    .channels_max = 16,
 		    .rates = es8323_RATES,
 		    .formats = es8323_FORMATS,
 		    },
-- 
2.34.1

